Error [E0999]: multiple `#[…]` marker lines belong in one comma-separated list
  --> tests/ui/stacked_type_markers.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | @[DenyUnknownFields]
    | ^
 Why: Jet attaches every marker on a type in a single `#[A, B]` group (D-ATTR2); one marker alone is `#A`
 Fix: merge them: `@[RenameAll(camel), Skip]`, or use `@RenameAll(camel)` when there is only one
